# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command watch
usage 1   watch add <space> <addr> <len> [write|read|both]
usage 2                                 register a watch, prints matching accesses live + stores them
usage 3                                 (default write, matching this command's original behavior)
usage 4   watch list                    list active watches with their IDs and access kind
usage 5   watch log <id> [<count>]      show a watch's recorded events (default 20)
usage 6   watch summary <id>            group a watch's recorded events by access site (Context),
usage 7                                 showing each unique site once with a hit count instead of
usage 8                                 every individual event - the dynamic, addressing-mode-agnostic
usage 9                                 equivalent of `readers`/`writers`, which only find statically-
usage 10                                 visible absolute/absolute-long instructions and miss indexed/
usage 11                                 indirect access entirely. Only covers whatever's still in the
usage 12                                 watch's own bounded event buffer, same as `watch log`.
usage 13   watch clear <id>              clear a watch's stored events (doesn't remove the watch)
usage 14   watch remove <id>             remove a watch entirely

case access watches
target fake
covers 1-14
$ watch
out 42
Usage: watch add|list|log|clear|remove ...
status 0
action none
$ watch list
out 18
No active watches.
status 0
action none
$ watch add
out 55
Usage: watch add <space> <addr> <len> [write|read|both]
status 0
action none
$ watch add RAM 10 4
out 37
Watch #1 added: RAM 0x10-0x13 (write)
status 0
action none
$ watch add RAM 20 2 read
out 36
Watch #2 added: RAM 0x20-0x21 (read)
status 0
action none
$ watch add VRAM 0 10 both
out 35
Watch #3 added: VRAM 0x0-0xF (both)
status 0
action none
$ watch add RAM 0 1 sideways
out 63
Error: Unknown watch kind 'sideways'. Use write, read, or both.
status 1
action none
$ watch add NOPE 0 1
out 83
Error: No memory space named 'NOPE'. Available: RAM, ROM, VRAM, IO, UNSIZED, CpuBus
status 1
action none
$ watch list
out 80
  #1: RAM 0x10-0x13 (write)
  #2: RAM 0x20-0x21 (read)
  #3: VRAM 0x0-0xF (both)
status 0
action none
$ watch log
out 31
Usage: watch log <id> [<count>]
status 0
action none
$ watch log 1
out 54
No events recorded for watch #1 (or it doesn't exist).
status 0
action none
$ watch log 1 4
out 54
No events recorded for watch #1 (or it doesn't exist).
status 0
action none
$ watch summary
out 25
Usage: watch summary <id>
status 0
action none
$ watch summary 1
out 54
No events recorded for watch #1 (or it doesn't exist).
status 0
action none
$ watch clear
out 23
Usage: watch clear <id>
status 0
action none
$ watch clear 1
out 28
Cleared events for watch #1.
status 0
action none
$ watch remove
out 24
Usage: watch remove <id>
status 0
action none
$ watch remove 2
out 17
Watch #2 removed.
status 0
action none
$ watch remove 2
out 18
No watch #2 found.
status 0
action none
$ watch list
out 53
  #1: RAM 0x10-0x13 (write)
  #3: VRAM 0x0-0xF (both)
status 0
action none
$ watch frob
out 73
Unknown 'watch' subcommand 'frob'. Try add/list/log/summary/clear/remove.
status 0
action none
$ watch add RAM zz 1
out 46
Error: Could not find any recognizable digits.
status 1
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ watch list
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end

case on venusrt
target venusrt
covers 1-4
$ watch add WRAM 0 100 both
out 36
Watch #1 added: WRAM 0x0-0xFF (both)
status 0
action none
$ watch list
out 26
  #1: WRAM 0x0-0xFF (both)
status 0
action none
end

case on moon
target moon
covers 1-4
$ watch add RAM 0 100 both
out 35
Watch #1 added: RAM 0x0-0xFF (both)
status 0
action none
$ watch list
out 25
  #1: RAM 0x0-0xFF (both)
status 0
action none
end

case on mercuryrt
target mercuryrt
covers 1-4
$ watch add WRAM 0 100 both
out 36
Watch #1 added: WRAM 0x0-0xFF (both)
status 0
action none
