case on nephrite
target nephrite
covers 1-4
$ watch add RAM 0 100 both
out 100
Error: No memory space named 'RAM'. Available: M68KBUS, Z80BUS, WRAM, Z80RAM, VRAM, CRAM, VSRAM, ROM
status 1
action none
$ watch list
out 18
No active watches.
status 0
action none
end
